---
description: TypeScript & React frontend conventions
globs: ["frontend/**/*.{ts,tsx}"]
alwaysApply: false
---

- Strict mode. No `any` — use `unknown` and narrow.
- One component per file, filename matches component name.
- Named exports for components; default export for pages only.
- `interface` for object shapes; no `type` aliases for objects.
- Explicitly handle `null` in every visual component (e.g., `benchmark: null`).
- No new libraries outside §2 without asking.